{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"feel\": \"起初有一种郑重、昂然的决心，却很快变得柔软、出神，带着隐约的忧伤和不安。几次想重新把握住什么，又陷入迟疑；临近结束时生出较为迫切的行动感，但仍谈不上踏实。\",\n  \"thread\": \"他确实有一样东西想堂堂正正地珍惜、守住，想到它，心里会生出真正的骄傲和勇气。但认真去面对这份珍惜时，他感到的不只有骄傲，还有很深的眷恋，以及对它能否真正留住的不安。那些让他向往的东西，也正是让他放心不下的东西。于是，最初想凭一股劲把事情认定的心情，渐渐变成了反复靠近、反复迟疑：他舍不得放下这份愿望，却也无法确信自己有能力实现它。到了最后，虽然还没有找到让自己安心的把握，想要真正着手的迫切已经越来越难以压下。\",\n  \"used\": \"无\",\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他有一样真正在乎、想要维护的东西，它能唤起他的骄傲和勇气，也牵动着深切的眷恋。\",\n    \"想要守住它的愿望是真实的，但愿望本身并不能保证它能够实现，这使向往与不安同时存在。\",\n    \"尚未获得把握，并没有削弱他想要有所作为的心，反而使这份迫切逐渐变得明确。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": \"无\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e4d4e688-112a-417a-8351-9e76098f98a7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215658092171Z", "elapsed_seconds": 183.453, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:00:01.551166+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4706a1988b3b80a00da5cf29cf3f1fe977852237c8a3ae1baf156f48f13f1648", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144c